The text in this repository is the Constitution of Kiribati as made, taken from The Kiribati Independence Order 1979 (SI 1979/719)
on legislation.gov.uk (https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/1979/719/made).
Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0
(https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/).
Lexifina's tooling and documentation in this repository are released under the MIT licence.
